      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَفْعَانُ</span></b>  or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَفْعَانٌ</span> (accord. to different copies of
the S and K) A man <i>who is struck</i> [or <i>slapped</i>]
<i>in the manner expl. above in the first paragraph;</i>
(S, Msb, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَصْفَعَانِىٌّ</span></b> . (O, K.)

